  "youtube": {
    "title": "The Secret Nobody Admits In Their 20s.",
    "description": "21, never been in a relationship, and too embarrassed to tell anyone.\n\nA short animated story about one of the most common secrets nobody talks about. He laughed the loudest at every party so nobody would ask, said \"nothing serious\", and slowly stopped showing up. Shame told him he was the only one. Shame lies.\n\nYou're far less alone than it feels: in a 2022 Pew Research Center survey, 63% of US men aged 18 to 29 said they were single. Most people in your shoes are just hiding it too.\n\nIf this is you:\n• Tell one person you trust. Secrets shrink when they're said out loud.\n• Don't stop living while you wait. Say yes to the hangouts, the classes, the trips.\n• There's no deadline. Comparing your timeline to someone's highlight reel only makes it louder.\n\nYou're not behind. You're on your own time.\n\nIf this helped, share it with someone who needs it, and subscribe for more.\n\n#selfimprovement #insecurity #relationships #latebloomer #mentalhealth #animation #motivation",
